		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Pony-sized undead spider animated by vilest sorcery. The hollow interior of the deathweb is filled with thousands of tiny spiders.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 12, <strong>HP</strong> 29, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 bite +4 (1d8 + poison) or 1 web +4, <strong>MV</strong> near (climb), <strong>S</strong> +2, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +2, <strong>I</strong> -3, <strong>W</strong> -1, <strong>Ch</strong> +0, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 6</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Poison</strong>. CON 15+ or 1d10 damage.</p><p></p><p><strong>Spiderlings</strong>. Dribbles a trail of minuscule spiders. If slain, 1d4 spider swarms burst free from the carcass.</p><p></p><p><strong>Web</strong>. One target stuck in place. DEX 15+ on turn to escape.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
